// imgIn, imgOut, y1, y2: i x j
//
// Optimizations:
// - Keep all traversals expressed via Noarr traversers.
// - Use traverser iterators to iterate outer dimensions (rows/columns) and
//   keep inner loops as for_each over the innermost dimension.
// - Parallelize over independent rows/columns with OpenMP pragmas where
//   available (ignored when compiled without -fopenmp).
// - Reduce repeated address calculations by:
//   * reusing the same traverser state in causal passes
//   * using a separate "reverse" state for anti-causal passes and updating
//     it with state arithmetic instead of recomputing indices every step
//   * reading/writing each bag element at most once per iteration
